OL,3,GNEWSARescue trucks stuck in sea after
OL,4,Achild rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo beach trucks have been recovered
OL,7,Fafter becoming trapped in sand and sea
OL,8,Fwhile a warden rescued a child who was
OL,9,Fstuck in the mud.
OL,11,FAfter one vehicle became trapped at
OL,12,FBrean beach, Somerset, a second truck
OL,13,Fwas deployed but also became lodged in
OL,14,Fthe thick mud on Wednesday.
OL,16,FSomerset Council, which is responsible
OL,17,Ffor the beach warden service, said the
OL,18,Fchild was taken to safety and no-one
OL,19,Fwas injured.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
